target:    tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
gate:      composer test:phpstan-baseline-ratchet
kind:      constant-weakening
expect:    tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING says 169 / 310
rationale: Raises the committed ceiling without the baseline changing. The exact-match half of the ratchet catches it; the descent half (against HEAD) is what stops the bump being made legitimately in the same commit as a regenerated, larger baseline. Regenerated when the ceiling descended 160/311 -> 159/310: the entry pins the current figure in both its diff and its expect string, so it stops applying whenever the ratchet does the thing it exists to encourage.
---
--- a/tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
+++ b/tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
@@ -1 +1 @@
-159 310
+169 310
